arch?q=uuid:3b2dd45b-e87d-4776-b37c-eb529e1efae0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3b2dd45b-e87d-4776-b37c-eb529e1efae0\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Garlow%27s_Place\" title=\"Old Garlow's Place\">Old Garlow's Place</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;799&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;746</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>List of Things To Do:\n</p><p><br>\n- Climb a tree\n</p><p><br>\n- Have a truly exceptional sandwich\n</p><p><br>\n- Spend a whole day reading\n</p><p><br>\n- Visit <a href=\"/wiki/Waterdeep\" title=\"Waterdeep\">Waterdeep</a>\n</p><p><br>\n- Get a massage\n</p><p><br>\n- Swim in the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Chionthar\" title=\"River Chionthar\">Chionthar</a>\n</p><p><br>\n- Buy a new coat\n</p><p><br>\n- Get a cat\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Greeting_to_this_Home%27s_New_Occupants\" title=\"A Greeting to this Home's New Occupants\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Book_Note_V_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_